  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "畢業專題研究",
    "sub_ename": "BACHELOR ’S  REPORT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為水利系大學部重要之必修科目，屬終端課程之一。由2-3人為一組，依專長或興趣選擇本系相關領域研究題目及指導教授。學生須先修習所選定論文領域之連貫式終端課程，經由教授指導及研究生的輔助，進行指定題目之實驗研究、撰寫論文及發表審查。學生經過專題實驗訓練，可學習到研究方法論、實驗設計技巧、數據分析、論文撰寫及口頭發表經驗。透過團隊合作方式之過程，培養學生負責任、分工合作及溝通技巧，建立就業或升學之基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "This is a required course for all undergraduate students, and is a final project type of training. Our department has three academic fields. Each team consists of 2 to 3 students and is responsible for producing an undergraduate thesis in a selected field . Students need to take related courses. Also, each team signs up a topic which is provided by a department faculty at the end of their senior year. During the following year, the faculty member will be their major advisor providing research guide on article reading, data collecting, experiment conducting, data analysis, issues compiling, thesis writing and presentation. Communication skill and team work are also an emphasis.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
